        "mission_intent": "Subject: Urgent \u2014 Need Comprehensive Deficiency Communication Package Finalized Before Board Meeting\n\nTeam, as we wrap up the FY2024 integrated audit, I need the engagement team to prepare and finalize the full suite of written communications regarding internal control deficiencies identified during our audit of internal control over financial reporting. Specifically, I need a single consolidated written communication to the audit committee that covers all identified deficiencies \u2014 material weaknesses, significant deficiencies, and lesser deficiencies alike \u2014 delivered as one package no later than Thursday so the board can review it at Friday's meeting. The communication to management regarding deficiencies of lesser magnitude than material weaknesses should also be prepared concurrently and reference that the audit committee has been notified. If we've concluded that the audit committee's oversight of external financial reporting and internal control is ineffective, that finding needs to go directly to the full board in the same package. I want us to use best efforts to ensure completeness, but I recognize the timeline is tight so use your professional judgment on the level of detail for each category. Please route all drafts through the engagement quality reviewer in Workiva before distribution and confirm back to me once issued.",
